          "body": "- A few more polishing touches. \n- All new classes have been documented. \n\nFolks, your feedback will be hugely appreciated\nOleg",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
